    "title": "Sycamore man accused of killing parents found unfit to stand trial - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Laura Neuzil ,\n1 days ago SYCAMORE, Ill. (WIFR) - The Sycamore man accused of killing his parents in their home last fall is found unfit to stand trial. Kevin Schmidt, 35, appeared Monday, May 18, in a DeKalb County courtroom for a civil jury trial to determine his mental fitness. Schmidt’s defense attorney, Chip Criswell, explains that under Illinois law a defendant can request a jury to determine whether they are fit to stand trial. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
